{"seq":3,"slug":"locale-detection-negotiation","title":"区域检测与内容协商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/locale-detection-negotiation","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"区域检测与内容协商\">区域检测与内容协商</h1><p>服务端如何在请求到达的瞬间确定「用户期望哪种语言和地区格式」，并从自身支持的 locale 集合中选出最优匹配——这个过程称为 locale negotiation。决策质量直接影响用户体验：选错语言意味着用户看到看不懂的内容，回退太激进则丢失可用的部分匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>信号优先级栈</strong>：用户 Profile &gt; URL 路径 &gt; Cookie &gt; Accept-Language &gt; GeoIP &gt; 默认值</li>\n<li><strong>CLDR Likely Subtags</strong>：比简单前缀截断更精确的 locale 推断（<code>zh-Hant</code> → <code>zh-Hant-TW</code> 而非 <code>zh-Hans-CN</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>内容协商模式</strong>：路径前缀（SEO + 缓存友好）是 2026 年主流选择</li>\n<li><strong>Fallback 可见性</strong>：响应中标注实际使用的 locale，支持客户端感知降级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"locale-信号源及其优先级\">Locale 信号源及其优先级</h2><p>后端可获取多种 locale 信号，每种信号的可靠度和覆盖面不同。正确的策略是<strong>按优先级栈逐级 fallback</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>信号源</th>\n<th>可靠度</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>用户 Profile 设置</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>仅登录用户</td>\n<td>用户显式选择，尊重最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>URL 路径/子域</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>依实现</td>\n<td><code>/ja/docs</code> 或 <code>ja.example.com</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Cookie/Session</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>回访用户</td>\n<td>记住上次选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>Accept-Language</code> 头</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>几乎所有请求</td>\n<td>浏览器/客户端自动发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>GeoIP</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有请求</td>\n<td>地理位置 ≠ 语言偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>默认 locale</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>配置的系统默认值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Request arrives] --&gt; B{User Profile&lt;br/&gt;has locale?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Yes| Z[Use profile locale]&#10;    B --&gt;|No| C{URL contains&lt;br/&gt;locale segment?}&#10;    C --&gt;|Yes| Z&#10;    C --&gt;|No| D{Cookie/Session&lt;br/&gt;has locale?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| Z&#10;    D --&gt;|No| E{Accept-Language&lt;br/&gt;header present?}&#10;    E --&gt;|Yes| F[Parse &amp; Negotiate]&#10;    E --&gt;|No| G{GeoIP&lt;br/&gt;available?}&#10;    G --&gt;|Yes| H[Map region → locale]&#10;    G --&gt;|No| I[Default locale]&#10;    F --&gt; Z&#10;    H --&gt; Z&#10;    I --&gt; Z&#10;    Z[Resolved Locale]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Request arrives] --&gt; B{User Profile&lt;br/&gt;has locale?}\n    B --&gt;|Yes| Z[Use profile locale]\n    B --&gt;|No| C{URL contains&lt;br/&gt;locale segment?}\n    C --&gt;|Yes| Z\n    C --&gt;|No| D{Cookie/Session&lt;br/&gt;has locale?}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| Z\n    D --&gt;|No| E{Accept-Language&lt;br/&gt;header present?}\n    E --&gt;|Yes| F[Parse &amp; Negotiate]\n    E --&gt;|No| G{GeoIP&lt;br/&gt;available?}\n    G --&gt;|Yes| H[Map region → locale]\n    G --&gt;|No| I[Default locale]\n    F --&gt; Z\n    H --&gt; Z\n    I --&gt; Z\n    Z[Resolved Locale]</pre><p><strong>GeoIP 的局限性</strong>：IP 地理定位得到的是物理位置，不是语言偏好。在旧金山的日本出差者需要日语界面，而非英语。GeoIP 适合作为最后兜底的粗粒度猜测，绝不应覆盖用户显式设置的 locale。</p>\n<h2 id=\"accept-language-头解析\">Accept-Language 头解析</h2><p>HTTP <code>Accept-Language</code> 头是 RFC 9110 定义的标准化 locale 信号。格式为带权重的 locale 列表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Accept-Language: ja-JP, ja;q=0.9, en-US;q=0.8, en;q=0.7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Accept-Language: ja-JP, ja;q=0.9, en-US;q=0.8, en;q=0.7</span></span></code></pre></div><p>权重 <code>q</code> 取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，默认为 1.0。解析算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>分割逗号分隔的条目</li>\n<li>提取 locale tag 和 q 值（缺省 q=1.0）</li>\n<li>按 q 值降序排列</li>\n<li>过滤 q=0 的条目（表示明确拒绝）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>解析时的常见陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>某些代理/CDN 会篡改或截断 <code>Accept-Language</code></li>\n<li>浏览器默认设置可能不反映用户真实偏好（系统语言 ≠ 内容偏好）</li>\n<li>移动端 WebView 可能不发送此头</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Accept-Language 解析&#10;interface LocalePreference {&#10;  tag: string;&#10;  quality: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function parseAcceptLanguage(header: string): LocalePreference[] {&#10;  return header&#10;    .split(&#39;,&#39;)&#10;    .map((entry) =&gt; {&#10;      const [tag, ...params] = entry.trim().split(&#39;;&#39;);&#10;      const qParam = params.find((p) =&gt; p.trim().startsWith(&#39;q=&#39;));&#10;      const quality = qParam ? parseFloat(qParam.split(&#39;=&#39;)[1]) : 1.0;&#10;      return { tag: tag.trim(), quality };&#10;    })&#10;    .filter((p) =&gt; p.quality &gt; 0)&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.quality - a.quality);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Accept-Language 解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocalePreference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseAcceptLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">header</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocalePreference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">';'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> qParam</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'q='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> quality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qParam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qParam.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: tag.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), quality };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.quality </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.quality </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.quality);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"locale-匹配算法\">Locale 匹配算法</h2><p>用户请求 <code>zh-Hant-HK</code> 但服务只支持 <code>zh-CN</code> 和 <code>zh-TW</code>——应该返回哪个？这是 locale 匹配的核心难题。</p>\n<p><strong>RFC 4647 定义两种匹配方案</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Basic Filtering</td>\n<td>前缀匹配 + 逐段去尾</td>\n<td><code>zh-Hant-HK</code> → <code>zh-Hant</code> → <code>zh</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lookup</td>\n<td>同 Basic，但只返回第一个命中</td>\n<td>用于只能选一个 locale 的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前缀匹配的问题：<code>zh</code> 匹配 <code>zh-CN</code>（简体），但 <code>zh-Hant-HK</code> 的用户明显期望繁体。CLDR 的 <strong>Likely Subtags</strong> 数据提供了更精确的推断：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>maximize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">zh-Hant</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">zh-Hant-TW</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{maximize}(\\texttt{zh-Hant}) = \\texttt{zh-Hant-TW}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">maximize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">zh-Hant</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">zh-Hant-TW</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>maximize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">zh</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">zh-Hans-CN</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{maximize}(\\texttt{zh}) = \\texttt{zh-Hans-CN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">maximize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">zh</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">zh-Hans-CN</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ICU4X 的 <code>LocaleFallbacker</code> 实现了基于 CLDR 数据的 locale fallback 链。以 ICU4X 2.2 为例，fallback 不再是简单的前缀截断，而是利用 CLDR 的 parent locale 数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"zh-Hant-HK → zh-Hant → und (不会 fallback 到 zh-Hans!)&#10;pt-MZ → pt-PT → und (不会 fallback 到 pt-BR!)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>zh-Hant-HK → zh-Hant → und (不会 fallback 到 zh-Hans!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pt-MZ → pt-PT → und (不会 fallback 到 pt-BR!)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这解决了经典的中文简繁体误匹配和葡萄牙语巴西/欧洲变体误匹配问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容协商的三种模式\">内容协商的三种模式</h2><p>后端实现多语言内容分发时，有三种架构模式可选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>URL 形式</th>\n<th>SEO</th>\n<th>缓存友好</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径前缀</td>\n<td><code>/ja/products</code></td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>路由层修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子域</td>\n<td><code>ja.example.com</code></td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>DNS + TLS 证书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Header/Cookie</td>\n<td><code>/products</code> + Header</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>需 Vary 头</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>路径前缀模式是 2026 年的主流选择——既有利于搜索引擎索引（每种语言有独立 URL），又天然适配 CDN 缓存（路径不同 = 缓存键不同）。</p>\n<p>无论选择哪种模式，响应都应包含正确的 HTTP 头告知缓存层和客户端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Content-Language: ja&#10;Vary: Accept-Language&#10;Link: &lt;/en/products&gt;; rel=&quot;alternate&quot;; hreflang=&quot;en&quot;&#10;Link: &lt;/ja/products&gt;; rel=&quot;alternate&quot;; hreflang=&quot;ja&quot;&#10;Link: &lt;/zh/products&gt;; rel=&quot;alternate&quot;; hreflang=&quot;zh&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Language: ja</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Vary: Accept-Language</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;/en/products>; rel=\"alternate\"; hreflang=\"en\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;/ja/products>; rel=\"alternate\"; hreflang=\"ja\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;/zh/products>; rel=\"alternate\"; hreflang=\"zh\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Vary: Accept-Language</code> 告诉中间缓存：同一 URL 对不同 <code>Accept-Language</code> 值应返回不同缓存副本。遗漏这个头会导致日语用户看到英语缓存——这是 CDN 层面最常见的 i18n bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务端-locale-解析的实现模式\">服务端 locale 解析的实现模式</h2><p>不同框架的 locale 中间件实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go + Chi router：locale 注入 context&#10;func LocaleMiddleware(supported []language.Tag, defaultTag language.Tag) func(http.Handler) http.Handler {&#10;    matcher := language.NewMatcher(supported)&#10;    return func(next http.Handler) http.Handler {&#10;        return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {&#10;            accept := r.Header.Get(&quot;Accept-Language&quot;)&#10;            tags, _, _ := language.ParseAcceptLanguage(accept)&#10;            tag, _, _ := matcher.Match(tags...)&#10;            ctx := context.WithValue(r.Context(), localeKey, tag)&#10;            next.ServeHTTP(w, r.WithContext(ctx))&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go + Chi router：locale 注入 context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocaleMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">supported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">defaultTag</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    matcher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> language.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewMatcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(supported)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HandlerFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResponseWriter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            accept </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.Header.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Accept-Language\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            tags, _, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> language.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ParseAcceptLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(accept)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            tag, _, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matcher.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), localeKey, tag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            next.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServeHTTP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Go 的 <code>golang.org/x/text/language</code> 包实现了 CLDR 匹配算法，<code>NewMatcher</code> 内置了 likely subtags 和 parent locale 逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"locale-fallback-链设计\">Locale Fallback 链设计</h2><p>生产系统的 fallback 不应该是简单的「匹配失败就用英语」。合理的 fallback 链能在没有完美匹配时仍提供可用体验：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;fr-CA&lt;br/&gt;(requested)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;fr-CA&lt;br/&gt;(exact match?)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|miss| C[&quot;fr&lt;br/&gt;(language match?)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|miss| D[&quot;en&lt;br/&gt;(default)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    E[&quot;zh-Hant-HK&lt;br/&gt;(requested)&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;zh-Hant-HK&lt;br/&gt;(exact?)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|miss| G[&quot;zh-Hant-TW&lt;br/&gt;(script match)&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|miss| H[&quot;en&lt;br/&gt;(default)&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"fr-CA&lt;br/&gt;(requested)\"] --&gt; B[\"fr-CA&lt;br/&gt;(exact match?)\"]\n    B --&gt;|miss| C[\"fr&lt;br/&gt;(language match?)\"]\n    C --&gt;|miss| D[\"en&lt;br/&gt;(default)\"]\n\n    E[\"zh-Hant-HK&lt;br/&gt;(requested)\"] --&gt; F[\"zh-Hant-HK&lt;br/&gt;(exact?)\"]\n    F --&gt;|miss| G[\"zh-Hant-TW&lt;br/&gt;(script match)\"]\n    G --&gt;|miss| H[\"en&lt;br/&gt;(default)\"]</pre><p>设计 fallback 链时的关键决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分翻译策略</strong>：如果 <code>fr-CA</code> 只有 60% 的翻译完成，是显示混合语言（法语+英语 fallback），还是整体降级到完全翻译的 <code>fr</code>？</li>\n<li><strong>Fallback 可见性</strong>：当 fallback 发生时，是否在 API 响应中标注 <code>&quot;resolved_locale&quot;: &quot;fr&quot;</code> 让客户端知道实际使用的不是请求的 locale？</li>\n<li><strong>每资源粒度 vs 全局粒度</strong>：CMS 中某篇文章有日语版本但无韩语版本，是按文章级别 fallback 还是整站 fallback？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐：响应中携带 <code>Content-Language</code> 头和/或响应体中的 <code>locale</code> 字段，让客户端能感知 fallback 是否发生。这支持客户端做 UI 提示（如「此页面暂无中文版本」）。详细的 locale 中间件架构设计见<a href=\"i18n-architecture-patterns\">国际化架构模式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Locale 检测与协商是后端 i18n 请求链路的第一步。信号优先级栈确保用户显式选择始终优先于自动推断；CLDR Likely Subtags 和 parent locale 数据让匹配算法避免中文简繁体和葡萄牙语变体的经典误匹配；路径前缀模式兼顾 SEO 与缓存友好性。响应中标注 resolved locale 和 Vary 头是让缓存层和客户端正确工作的必要条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"区域检测与内容协商","id":"区域检测与内容协商"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Locale 信号源及其优先级","id":"locale-信号源及其优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"Accept-Language 头解析","id":"accept-language-头解析"},{"level":2,"text":"Locale 匹配算法","id":"locale-匹配算法"},{"level":2,"text":"内容协商的三种模式","id":"内容协商的三种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端 locale 解析的实现模式","id":"服务端-locale-解析的实现模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Locale Fallback 链设计","id":"locale-fallback-链设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Unicode 编码与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/unicode-encoding-normalization"},"next":{"title":"时区与日期时间处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/timezone-datetime-handling"}}